							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Karshak, chill out, Im not even about to get into a fight with you about any of this.  I said &quot;most of the accomplishments&quot;, not all.  I enjoy reading about another guilds getting elemental flagged, or Time flagged, or some other stepping stone, but some of the stuff is kinda silly, especially when the people saying it act as though their shit dont stink.  As for being elitest, how often have you seen EiE/DA come in here and post our new server firsts?  Hell we&#039;ve had about 7 or 8 just this past month or two.  We just do our thing, thats it.  <br /><br />And yes I moved up, but Id still be in Forsaken if it was still here, but that choice was made for me.  Im not an elitest, far from it.  I log on and raid and do what Im told, then log off.  Ive long ago lost the love for this game, its now just about beating it and spending some time with a few friends that are left.  <br /><br />All I was trying to say was that you all just need to chill on the personal bashing.  This is a top 10 thread.</td>
