							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Honestly most of the last 10 pages or so of this thread shouldnt even be in the top 10, it should be in the rants and raves.&nbsp; Prodigy and Plinko, when you feel like complaining or &quot;expressing your opinions&quot;, honestly guys it would do much better to just talk about it amongst each other; hell send me a tell if you want to, but dont come here where the vultures are.&nbsp; Take it from someone who knows.&nbsp; <br /><br />Conviction, honestly Im ashamed that I wore your tag when I see some of the posts here by your officers and members.&nbsp; I thought you had more class than that.&nbsp; That was the one thing that the &quot;older Conviction&quot; players did seem to manage well, staying out of most of the RN drama.&nbsp; It didnt take 20 or so posts by you guys to make Plinko look any more of a douche for anon posting a bunch of crap.&nbsp; So let it go already, you all look like the class bullies.<br /><br />Im not even going to get into the whole pevis waving stuff, because most of the accomplishments that are posted here are honestly not even worth a second glance.&nbsp; Do something spectacular or change your 1-10 spot and then post.&nbsp; Other than that just be happy with your friends and enjoy what you are doing and the trip there, because most of us just dont care about half of this crap.<br /><br />btw...great post Dalla.</td>
