						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">I think people confuse themselves with Time because its instanced.&nbsp; Its still first come first serve, just like any other mob.&nbsp; Just because there have been gentlemanly agreements for some guilds to do it on certain days doesnt make it set in stone.&nbsp; The agreements were usually made just to alleviate the headaches of having to rush and beat other guilds and they were made tipping to the higher level guilds favor as to what days they wanted.&nbsp; <br /><br />It was also kinda taken for granted that if someone higher on the food chain than you wanted a certain day and beat ya to it, then the lowbies had to step out of the way and basically deal with it.&nbsp; &nbsp;I remember when I was in Forsaken, EiE was pretty much done with Time, so we could have the zone usually about 4 days if we wanted since Ascent cleared in 1 day and FoT could clear in 1-2 days.&nbsp; But if EiE wanted in they took it.&nbsp; Sure it sucked but hell they beat us there and they deserved it.&nbsp; &nbsp;What if we decided to come back now and farm Time for apps, would you complain then?<br /><br />The deal is with any contested zone/mob, always be ready for someone to come in and take it.&nbsp; If you cant muster a raid force until later, dont be shocked if someone has beat you to it.&nbsp; Stop complaining and play the game.&nbsp; Sure it sucks, but its not Ascents fault you only raid 3 days a week and friday just happened to be one of those days, and honestly its not their concern to keep everyone happy, what if that day was the day they had the most on?&nbsp; Hell maybe they were being asshats and took it to spite you, but does that surprise you?&nbsp; Theyve always liked a little drama here and there to wave their schlongs at...hehe.&nbsp; What will you do when there are about 2 more guilds Time flagged?&nbsp; You can only have 4 instances going at a time I thought.&nbsp; Just be prepared and beat them at their own game =)<br /><br />/hugs Slayyerr, dont let this stuff get ya down =)<br /></td>
